menu "Status LED"

config DL_LED_GPIO
    int "WS2812 data GPIO"
    default 48
    range 0 48
    help
        The YD-ESP32-S3 / DevKitC-1 layout puts the onboard pixel on GPIO48.
        Some clone revisions ship with the RGB solder jumper open; if the
        LED stays dark on a fresh board, bridge it before suspecting code.

choice DL_LED_ORDER
    prompt "WS2812 colour order"
    default DL_LED_ORDER_GRB

config DL_LED_ORDER_GRB
    bool "GRB (ordinary WS2812B, most clone boards)"

config DL_LED_ORDER_RGB
    bool "RGB (Espressif DevKitC-1 onboard pixel)"

endchoice

config DL_LED_BRIGHTNESS
    int "Brightness (%)"
    default 15
    range 1 100
    help
        The SuperMini's pixel sits bare on the board and is glaring at
        full drive; 15% reads clearly across a room.

endmenu
